// Icon of sss-wallpaper.exe. Explorer shows the icon with the lowest ID.
// The path is relative to this file.
// The compiled sss-wallpaper.res is committed, because rc.exe is not on the PATH
// of a normal shell or of CI. Compile it again after changing the icon:
//   rc /fo sss-wallpaper.res sss-wallpaper.rc
1 ICON "..\..\images\icon.ico"
